@startuml F7.4-ERRO-03-tipo-com-historico
title F7.4-ERRO-03 — 422 excluir RequestType com histórico
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "DeleteRequestTypeUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Excluir tipo
WebApp -> Jwt: DELETE /request-types/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: count histórico
Postgres --> UC: N > 0
note right of UC
  sem DELETE
end note
UC --> WebApp: 422 request_type_in_use
WebApp --> Admin: AlertBanner

@enduml
